    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4df0f375dcffa8d621c836",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我，好像稍微有点理解Cosplay的人的心情了。\n根底首先是对角色的爱意――那是，爱意满溢而出的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edbf15474ccc7d270798350ba1b1ec2dfe6269f177e82ebf57c82c426285391c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
