    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53792535e00303e2fd01f1ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要通过某种方式表现这份爱！　在这前方的手段之一，\n也许就是Cosplay吧。站在舞台上，我有那种感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac82ff16f7f54e8aa47a229a1599113b79b0e7dde90bf5f83f46628d37ebede2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
