      "uid": "zhcn:70a775a784495dd1994dce72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从决定角色，到决胜姿势，还有商量使用的台词……\n两个人一起做的每一件事都好开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c9f68edc0953b5f26287ff4a24bfab31d3501a986cf950cb259fcafe6aaf36",
